script 0 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Noism
	"기계가 잔뜩!\n소음도 잔뜩!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 1 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Noism
	"크든 작든\n소음은 소음이야."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 2 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Noism
	"나 같은 노이시즘 중에는\n지능이 아주 높은\n녀석들도 있어..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"아, 네가 알면 좋을 만한 게 하나\n더 있는데... 우리 노이시즘은\n[KItem0013]s를 좋아해."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그걸 모으는 녀석들도 있어.\n그러니까 찾아보는 것도\n좋은 생각일 거야."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
